ders only:\nCombined shipping is available for multiple items but must be requested through customer service prior to completing payment. This process is not automatic, and no refunds will be issued for combined shipping after payment has been processed.\nPlease note:\nWhat is pictured is what is in the box/bag. As this is an assorted bulk jewelry items, there are no guarantees in regards to the items included and condition. This will contain some combination of mismatched, damaged, craft/costume jewelry, and accessories. Note that the auctions are typically shipped in bulk and not packaged individually. This auction is not available for closer examination or additional information or pictures beyond what has been disclosed. Coin lots have been sorted as to not contain any US coins or currency or non-monetary items. However, a few may be missed and could be included.\nNo returns or refunds will be accepted for this auction. By placing a bid on this auction, you accept this as a condition of the sale.\nOversized Prints, Paintings & Framed Artwork – Shipping Disclaimer\nSome oversized prints, paintings, and framed artwork may be listed as",
